Typical UX/UI Workflow
=======================
Brainstorming → FigJam
Mind Mapping → FigJam
Moodboard → FigJam (most common)
Wireframe → Figma Design (or FigJam for low-fidelity wireframes)
Mockup / Visual Design → Figma Design
Prototype → Figma Design
Testing & Iteration → Figma Design (with feedback often discussed in FigJam)

So, while a moodboard can be created in either tool, FigJam is usually the 
preferred choice for moodboards because it is designed for ideation and 
collaboration.
